WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.300
It's nighttime. Why are you
opening the curtains?

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:10.380
Because!

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:15.310
Look how beautiful the stars are!
How can you close the curtains on them?

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.270
I thought only I knew that smile.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:24.400
And those sparkling
stardust eyes...

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.670
Only I know your pain...

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:52.180
Your uncertainty...

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:55.510
Your loneliness...

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.210
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.690
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.910
I will not betray you!

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:08.910
Morning, Yuki-chan!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:09.500
Morning.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.430
Good morning.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.080
That smells great!

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:19.680
This morning, I tried to make some Italian
home cooking, with ingredients I ordered.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.960
Please have as much as you'd like.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.690
Hooray!

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:25.850
Toko-chan, what about your diet?

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.850
T-Tomorrow! D-Didn't I say
I'd start tomorrow?

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:30.560
Was that what you said?

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.530
You're all lively this morning.

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:35.500
Good morning!

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.660
Morning.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:40.750
How unusual...
Shu-kun isn't here yet.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:44.580
That is strange. But typical for Hotsuma...

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:49.630
Scars

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.920
Shusei-kun?

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:05.780
Come in.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.310
Good morning.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:12.290
Breakfast is ready,
so why don't you...

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.220
Oh, sorry!

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:19.030
I got this from a burn.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.740
It happened a long time ago.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:24.100
Don't worry about it.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:29.290
Unfortunately, not even you can heal it.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.100
Shusei-kun, what about breakfast?

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.120
Sorry. I'm going to just go.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:41.680
I wish something would
make this disappear...

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:45.630
Is something the matter?

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:47.910
Luka...

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:54.500
I was wondering what kinds of
injuries are beyond my healing.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.440
Friends...

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.870
Friends?

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:04.240
No one can erase the scars
caused by friends.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:12.430
What? Shusei left without
eating breakfast again?

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:13.210
Y-Yes.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.010
That bastard.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:18.410
Hotsuma-kun!

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:24.110
I made some sandwiches.
Could you give them to Shusei-san?

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:25.100
Thanks.

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:32.610
Hotsuma-kun and Shusei-kun
really get along, don't they?

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:36.480
Those two have been
inseparable since childhood.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.230
Really?

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:42.530
Zweilt are special to one other.
Right, Tsukumo?

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:43.280
Yup.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.490
I see...

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:49.860
But Hotsu's been agitated since
Yuki-kun arrived here.

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.340
What? Really?

00:05:58.340 --> 00:05:59.400
Eat!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:03.210
You know this is a second-year
classroom, right?

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.600
So what?

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:08.780
Just eat your breakfast!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:13.070
And stop leaving without me. Got it?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.070
You're being ridiculous.

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.740
I'm serious here.

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:21.480
Fine. I'll be more careful.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:25.120
There's something wrong...

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.040
No, I'm fine.

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:32.370
What's bothering you so much
that you can't even eat?

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:34.790
You mean, you don't know?

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:40.170
You're the only thing I think about.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:44.590
Cut the crap! I'm just worried about you!

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:49.970
Damn! Out of time.
Make sure you eat that!

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:53.300
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.350
Are you all right?

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.140
U-Usui-kun...

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.370
Sorry about that.
Are you okay?

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:03.300
I'm fine. I'm really sorry.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.550
Watch where you're going.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:08.280
Here.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.960
What are the details of the case?

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:24.180
The victim taught in the city,
at a public high school.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:28.260
Five days before the incident,
his family reported him missing.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:32.600
He vanished suddenly,
without bringing anything along.

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:38.120
In the past two weeks, a string of similar
missing persons cases has occurred.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.370
This is, at least, the eighth person.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:43.110
Of the eight cases, seven have been
male high school students.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:48.360
However, there are no connections among
the seven students or with this teacher.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.920
Their schools and ages are all over the place.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:53.040
The key is "high school."

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:57.500
Makes you wonder about this
"Sleeping Beauty" syndrome.

00:07:57.930 --> 00:07:59.880
Sleeping Beauty syndrome?

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:04.470
It's just an interesting story the
media came up with.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:08.590
Something about female high school
students who never wake up.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:11.890
I don't believe it has anything
to do with this, though.

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:16.080
That aside... What do you
make of this case?

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:17.480
Yes...

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:20.460
It sounds like our jurisdiction.

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:25.690
We'll find the culprit and the remaining
victims as quickly as we can.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.660
We've already contacted an
expert at finding lost things.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:32.910
Go ahead, Toko-chan.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:35.580
Wait here, okay?

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:36.290
Okay.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.570
Do you need help?

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:44.010
Takashiro-sama called you here, too?

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:44.550
Yes.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.990
Are you all right?
You don't seem well.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:54.690
Hotsuma said the same thing.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.890
Yuki came here, so...

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:04.440
I like you, Shusei...

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.730
It goes without saying
that I like Yuki, too.

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:10.740
I know.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:17.040
That's why I want you both to be okay.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.600
Let's go.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:24.040
Huh?

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.100
Tsukumo and Toko asked me
to look after you.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:28.340
Hurry up.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.830
O-Okay.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.830
This is Renjo-kun's...

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.970
Do you want to go to the House of Divination?

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:06.590
Yeah, their love predictions always come true.
Everyone's been talking about it.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.130
U-Um...

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:15.860
Tsukumo-kun and Toko-chan went
to help Takashiro-san, didn't they?

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:16.960
Yeah.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:21.340
Everyone's so amazing,
using their abilities to help out.

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:24.270
You've got your God's Voice.

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:28.230
God's Voice is just what
people decided to call it.

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:35.240
All I can do with that voice
is kill my enemies.

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:39.330
I call hellfire down on my victims.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:41.500
They all call it God's Voice,

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:45.500
but it bothers them more
than any other power.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:47.750
That's why you-

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.680
You're kind, Hotsuma-kun.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.340
What?

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:58.560
The color of your kindness is
extremely pale, but it's very warm.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.820
That's how it feels to me.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.190
You don't know...

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:09.090
What?

00:11:09.090 --> 00:11:13.200
You don't know what you're talking about!

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.560
Stop!

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:47.930
There's no hope. Everyone, they just...

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:51.030
Everyone leaves.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:04.360
Hotsuma!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.440
Shusei, they know.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:15.110
They all know I set people on fire.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:20.420
No one even tries to look at me.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.500
Shusei...

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:33.720
Shusei, I'm really here, aren't I?

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:41.950
Welcome home.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.920
Stupid.

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:51.250
You got mad at Yuki again, didn't you?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.620
It's because he's an idiot.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.910
He doesn't know any other way.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:02.230
I got this for you from Yuki.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.200
I told you, I don't need it.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:08.580
I promised to give it to you.
If you want to return it, do it yourself.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.610
You haven't changed.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.700
Try being honest.

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:20.660
You...

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:28.460
You'll always stay with me, won't you?

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.300
If that's what you want.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:42.850
I told you not to worry about it.

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.270
I'll spend my whole life atoning for it.

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:50.980
Good night.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.780
Welcome.

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:10.660
Lost lamb...

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:16.380
I'll grant you power.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:21.080
House of Divination

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:27.370
Welcome to the House of Divination.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:49.000
Uh, yesterday, I...

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:54.240
Hotsu, I'd like to talk to you
about something. Got a minute?

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:07.610
Luka.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.430
Are you all right?

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:11.330
Yes.

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:14.630
Everyone has wounds that cannot be erased.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.690
Wounds that cannot be erased...

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.190
You're kidding!

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:22.530
Why do I have to see him?

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.820
I'm not saying you have to.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:31.710
They're requesting to see you,
so I'm asking what you'd like to do.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.020
All they want is money!

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:39.020
Tell Takashiro to give them
as much as they want!

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:45.680
It's been three years since we
last heard from them...

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:51.390
The Giou Clan pays a Zweilt's parents handsomely,
in return for their children.

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:54.390
They're calling for the payment.

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:00.100
He knows...

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:05.400
His parents abandoned him.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:11.220
Shusei-kun...

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.540
Go to him.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:16.790
He needs you.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:31.680
<i>I can't take it anymore!</i>

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:35.860
<i>At this rate, he'll kill us, too!</i>

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:40.770
<i>Just hang in there.
The Giou Clan will take him soon.</i>

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:47.060
<i>We're always monitoring his moods.
I can't keep living in fear.</i>

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.620
<i>They call it God's Voice...</i>

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:53.410
<i>He's nothing more than a monster!</i>

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.750
Hotsuma-kun.

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.580
You again?

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.030
Are you okay?

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.280
It's fine.

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:08.870
I'm just concerned about you.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:10.470
Shut up!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:16.360
You don't understand anything,
so quit worrying about me!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:20.940
Just worry about yourself.

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:30.200
<i>He's nothing more than a monster!</i>

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.160
No... This...

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.030
Let go!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:34.820
Let go of me!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:35.620
No!

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:37.790
Let go, damn it!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:41.000
No matter what you say...
No matter what you think...

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.210
I won't let go!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.970
You...

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:49.590
Let go!

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:53.300
That's right...

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:59.920
Unwanted, feared, worthless...

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.770
I should have done this a long time ago.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:10.530
Die, Renjo Hotsuma.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.420
Hotsuma!

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:28.670
Idiot, let go of me!
You'll burn, too!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:33.550
I won't let go! If you do this,
we can't ever be together again!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.140
If you still want to die,

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.210
take me with you!

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:43.400
No.

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:46.940
I don't want to hurt anyone else...

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:51.770
<i>Stop!</i>

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:00.890
So, you can control it.

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:09.360
You chose to stop it, didn't you?

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:14.430
I knew you were kind.

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.640
You're not a monster.

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.850
You're a human being.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:29.360
I thought you would stop him.

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:35.610
Hotsuma is fine.
Yuki healed his injuries.

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:40.080
He will protect Yuki, body and soul.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:46.360
But who will heal your wound?

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:55.860
I knew Yuki would be the one
to quench you. Not me...

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:57.760
But still...

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:01.360
I can't live without you.

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:09.230
I've served my purpose.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:25.620
Shusei's gone...

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.130
What does that mean...

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:41.010
Shusei's gone?

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.140
He left me!

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:48.560
What are you talking about, Tsukumo?
I don't understand!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.690
Where'd Shusei go?

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:54.370
There's no way you wouldn't
know where he went!

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:57.660
I can't sense his presence at all.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:01.740
All I can say is that he
suddenly disappeared.

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:04.120
Hotsuma-kun!

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:14.670
Let go!

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:16.370
Release me!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.190
Let go of me, Tsukumo!

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:20.420
Calm down! What are you doing?

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:22.100
I'm going to look for him!

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:23.560
Look for him? Where?

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:26.100
Everywhere!

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:29.730
I told you, even I can't
tell where he is!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:46.370
You said you'd stay with me.

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:56.840
You said you'd always stay with me...

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:01.870
<i>Shusei!</i>

00:23:35.660 --> 00:23:38.620
Hey, Tsukumo, which pajamas should
we wear for summer?

00:23:38.620 --> 00:23:40.070
Whatever you want is fine.

00:23:40.070 --> 00:23:43.000
What about these arabesque ones?
Cute, aren't they?

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:45.500
I think Hotsuma said he wanted those, too.

00:23:45.970 --> 00:23:49.820
Cry of Despair

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:49.950
What? Then never mind!
They're not cute anyway!
